		{
			dependencies: ["5B64CE917218050A"]
			description: [
				"&f Welcome to Mars: The Crimson Frontier&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"After conquering the Moon, your next destination lies farther and more forbidding-&cMars&r. A planet of &4red sands&r, jagged canyons, and windswept mountains, it holds the remnants of forgotten civilizations and the promise of untapped power."
				""
				"Beneath its desolate surface lie &6ancient secrets&r and &eexclusive resources&r essential for your interstellar progression. But be warned-Mars is no place for the unprepared."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &catmosphere is thin&r, the &cenvironment is brutal&r, and the dangers are far deadlier than anything you’ve faced before. You’ll need your best armor, oxygen supplies, and unwavering resolve to survive."
				""
				"&lReady your gear, fuel your rocket, and prepare to step into the unknown-the red frontier awaits.&r"
			]
