		{
			dependencies: ["6169F8EB0E600750"]
			description: [
				"Buried deep within the frozen wastes of Mars’ Polar Ice Caps lies a fortress forged from blackstone, lava, and steel."
				""
				"Here, the &4Netherite Monstrosity&r has taken refuge."
				""
				"Once a devastating force within the Nether, the Monstrosity fled across the stars in an attempt to escape the destruction left in its wake. Yet even upon the frozen surface of Mars, its rage continues to grow, corrupting the surrounding fortress with fire and ruin."
				""
				"To continue your journey toward &5The End&r, you must track the beast through the icy wastelands and bring an end to its reign."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/soul_blacksmith_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Unlike many foes, the &4Netherite Monstrosity&r requires no ritual or summoning."
				""
				"Simply entering its domain is enough to awaken the beast."
				""
				"The moment it senses your presence, the fortress will erupt into chaos as molten fury and crushing strength are unleashed upon you. Prepare carefully before approaching - this battle is one of endurance, positioning, and survival."
				""
				"Once you step forward, there is no turning back."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beyond the Monstrosity’s throne lies a hidden reward for those observant enough to seek it out."
				""
				"Concealed behind the massive lavafalls on either side of the arena is a secret vault containing valuable loot and mysterious &dExperience Blocks&r."
				""
				"Break the experience blocks hidden within the vault to claim the forgotten riches buried beneath the fortress."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/experience_blocks.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
			]
