		{
			dependencies: ["6169F8EB0E600750"]
			description: [
				"&7The surface of Mars is filled with the ruins of forgotten civilizations, ancient temples, and dangerous strongholds buried beneath endless crimson sands.&r"
				""
				"As you explore the harsh Martian landscape, you will uncover mysterious structures containing powerful enemies, valuable loot, and long-lost secrets hidden deep within the planet’s ruins."
				""
				"Each discovery may provide the resources and knowledge needed to continue your expansion deeper into the solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMars Temple&r"
				"Scattered across the deserts of Mars, the ancient &cMars Temple&r stands as a relic of a forgotten age. Though worn down by time and endless sandstorms, these temples still contain hidden treasures and dangerous guardians protecting what remains inside."
				""
				"Explorers willing to brave the temple’s halls may uncover valuable resources and rare rewards essential for future progression."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_temple.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMars Tower Dungeon&r"
				"Rising high above the Martian surface, the &4Mars Tower Dungeon&r is one of the most dangerous structures found on the planet. These towering fortresses are filled with hostile enemies, difficult encounters, and valuable loot awaiting those strong enough to reach the summit."
				""
				"Each level presents greater danger, but also greater reward."
				""
				"Only the prepared will survive the climb."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_tower_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lInfernal Altar&r"
				"Hidden among the wastelands of Mars lies the ominous &6Infernal Altar&r, a corrupted structure radiating dangerous energy. Its origins remain unknown, but the creatures surrounding it suggest something far darker once took place here."
				""
				"Those brave enough to investigate may uncover rare loot and powerful materials unlike anything found elsewhere on the planet."
				""
				"Approach carefully - not all ruins were meant to be disturbed, if adventorous right click a nether star on the altar to summon the beast within."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/infernal_altar.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:orange_flag"
			id: "7A77DB9E2A635701"
