		{
			dependencies: ["678525271134A9C1"]
			description: [
				"Found upon the scorched terrain of &cVenus&r lies the &cPyroclast Vent&r-one of the rare molten geysers essential for producing &6Calorite&r, a powerful metal forged in heat and pressure."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/pyroclast_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To activate this volcanic marvel, place &la blaze burner and feed it blaze cake&r atop the dormant vent and ignite it. The resulting transformation will awaken the structure, converting it into a functional &omolten core&r."
				""
				"Once awakened, supply the correct &dsource fluid&r (covered in the next quest) to begin your Calorite automation through &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				" &cThe inferno calls-will you rise with it or be turned to ash?&r"
			]
			icon: "create_resource_vents:dormant_pyroclast_vent"
