		{
			dependencies: ["18FE88DC4331C399"]
			description: [
				"&7The ice calls to those bold enough to brave its silence and storms.&r"
				""
				" &bCongratulations, daring adventurer!&r  "
				"With the &lTier 4 Rocket&r now at your command, the &ofrozen realm of Glacio&r awaits your arrival! Fuel up, strap in, and prepare to break through the stratosphere into a world of snow, silence, and ancient power."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Upon landing, you’ll face a landscape of &bglacial beauty&r and &ohidden peril&r. Scattered across the terrain are:"
				""
				"-  &3Ancient structures&r steeped in mystery  "
				"-  Rare &oAE2 meteorites&r containing lost technologies  "
				"-  Secrets frozen in time, waiting for the brave"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"With every step across this icy world, you’ll uncover rare resources, powerful artifacts, and forgotten knowledge buried beneath the frost."
				""
				" &lThe Frozen Frontier&r beckons-will you seize its secrets or succumb to the cold?"
				""
